OL,3,GNEWSAHouse takes direct lightning hit
OL,4,Aamid thunderstorms
OL,5,
OL,6,FA house in Cleethorpes was damaged when
OL,7,Fit took a direct hit from a lightning
OL,8,Fstrike as thunderstorms swept across
OL,9,Fthe country in the early hours of
OL,10,FFriday.
OL,12,FVideo captured by a neighbour's
OL,13,Fdoorbell camera showed the bolt hitting
OL,14,Fthe roof and footage filmed later
OL,15,Fduring daylight revealed the chimney
OL,16,Fhad been badly damaged, leaving bricks
OL,17,Fstrewn across the roof.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
