OL,3,GNEWSAHouse takes direct lightning hit
OL,4,Aamid thunderstorms
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe incident came after the Met Office
OL,7,Fissued yellow thunderstorms warnings
OL,8,Ffor parts of the UK, including
OL,9,FLincolnshire, until 21:00 BST on
OL,10,FFriday.
OL,12,FThe warning means storms could cause
OL,13,Ftravel disruption, damage to homes and
OL,14,Fbusinesses and flooding.
